1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,650
(Sheldon:)to Q&A from the audience?

2
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:03,050
(Penny(voice):)Yeah, I have a question.

3
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,550
(Penny(voice):)Is there anybody who can get me
the hell out of here

4
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:07,720
(Penny(voice):)and back to Los Angeles
tonight?

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:10,530
(Glenn(voice):)I'm driving back to L.A. tonight.

6
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:15,100
(Bernadette:)Penny, that's Glenn.
Glenn, that's Penny.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,960
(Howard:)No!

8
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:28,940
(Penny:)SHELDON
Red Leader to Red Five.

9
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:31,940
(Sheldon:)Red Leader
to Red Five.

10
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:35,050
(Sheldon(voice):)Anybody up for a little game?

11
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:39,320
(Sheldon(voice):)I spy with my little eye...

12
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:42,480
(Sheldon(voice):)a nonferrous metal.

13
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:49,520
(Sheldon:)Must be out of range.

14
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,820
(Amy:)Leonard, can I ask you
a question?

15
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,220
(Sheldon:)Sure.

16
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:56,530
(Amy:)Are you bothered by the fact
that your former girlfriend

17
00:00:56,530 --> 00:00:58,230
(Amy:)left the symposium
with what is probably

18
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:02,270
(Amy:)the most beautiful man
I've ever seen in my life?

19
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:04,330
(Leonard:)No. Why do you ask?

20
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,670
(Amy:)Because we're going
120 miles per hour.

21
00:01:09,270 --> 00:01:11,210
(Sheldon:)All right, if no one's going
to guess...

22
00:01:11,210 --> 00:01:15,310
I was spying the aluminum rims
on the police car

23
00:01:15,310 --> 00:01:17,020
(Sheldon:)we passed a few miles back.

